# Allow-list: the Dockerfile only needs the files below. Everything else (target/ with several GB of
# build artefacts, the FireHOL clone, *.mmdb, .git/, IDE files) would otherwise be sent to the
# builder on every `docker build`.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!build.rs
!Makefile
!geoip2-rs.patch
!.cargo
!src
# Cargo validates the [[bench]] target declared in Cargo.toml even for `cargo build`.
!benches
firehol-blocklist-ipsets/